# graphify knowledge-graph outputs — all regenerable, so none of it is tracked.
# The viewer is published instead as public/graph.html (committed); re-copy it
# there after a regen rather than committing graphify-out/graph.html twice.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
